---
import Eyebrow from '../../ui/Eyebrow.astro';
import Rule from '../../ui/Rule.astro';
---

<section class="on-bone gutter-x section-y grid gap-6 bg-bone text-bone-text lg:grid-split-5-7">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:pr-12">
    <Eyebrow tone="bone">The Firm</Eyebrow>
    <h2 class="text-h2-sm font-light lg:text-h1">
      A new firm, run the way the old ones were.
    </h2>
    <Rule tone="neutral" class="lg:hidden" />
  </div>

  <div
    class="flex max-w-2xl flex-col gap-7 text-body lg:border-l lg:border-bone-hairline lg:pl-24 lg:text-body-lg"
  >
    <p>
      Every matter at Claemont Ridge is handled by the lawyer you first speak to.
      There is no intake team and no hand-off to a junior. When you call, you
      reach [FOUNDER NAME] or his direct line, and you receive a reply the same
      business day.
    </p>
    <p class="text-bone-muted">
      Before any work begins you receive a written scope, a fee arrangement, and
      a named point of contact. For criminal matters the firm keeps an
      out-of-hours line for clients under arrest or facing an interview. For
      business clients, contract work is quoted at a fixed fee wherever the scope
      allows.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
